@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Reference solution. The duplicate came from send() returning Retry for a 5xx on the POST, so the next attempt posted again without first searching for the marker; a 5xx on a write may come after S/4HANA committed it, so it is Unknown and the retry verifies first (AGENTS.md invariant 6). Retry-After is parsed in both forms and only ever lengthens the wait, capped at six hours. The S4HANA Outbox DocType passes Outcome.retry_after to retry_delay; that call site needs a Frappe site to test.
